# 2) 求 [100,130) 的屏幕坐标（中文裸文本偏移；零宽锚点不占字符，逐文本节点累加即可）
coords = js("""(() => {
  const b = document.querySelector('[data-b="b-0011"]');
  const inl = b.querySelector('.b-inline[data-lang="zh"]');
  const w = document.createTreeWalker(inl, NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT);
  let acc = 0, startPt = null, endPt = null;
  const S = 100, E = 130;
  let n;
  while ((n = w.nextNode())) {
    const len = n.data.length;
    const s0 = acc, e0 = acc + len;
    if (startPt === null && S >= s0 && S < e0) startPt = [n, S - s0];
    if (endPt === null && E > s0 && E <= e0) endPt = [n, E - s0];
    acc = e0;
  }
  if (!startPt || !endPt) return JSON.stringify({err: 'offset out of text', total: acc});
  const r = document.createRange();
  r.setStart(startPt[0], startPt[1]); r.setEnd(endPt[0], endPt[1]);
  const rects = [...r.getClientRects()];
  const a = rects[0], z = rects[rects.length-1];
  return JSON.stringify({
    total: acc,
    text: r.toString(),
    start: {x: Math.round(a.x + 2), y: Math.round(a.y + a.height/2)},
    end: {x: Math.round(z.x + z.width - 2), y: Math.round(z.y + z.height/2)},
    inView: a.y > 60 && a.y < window.innerHeight - 60,
  });
})()""")
